    "title": "L11 Performance-oriented DOM intelligence: implementation (host, packaging, runner, Recorder, Spy/Designer, normalization, status)",
    "objective": "Implement L11 (awkit-djnl.19) per docs/plans/ai-upgrade-v5/L11-performance-dom-intelligence.md on the owner's 2026-09-30 decision. Unleased direct-loop work covers src/runner (snapshot recovery, provider contract, references), src/recorder, app/main IPC and lifecycle, the renderer, verifiers, mock-site scenarios and docs. This contract routes the Risk-3 slices: the parser-only Scrapling host under native-hosts/dom-intelligence (runtime), the offline runtime pin in src/offline, the packaging scripts, third-party notices and the signed dependency manifest (release), and the tracker (project-state). Playwright stays the only browser and action authority; the host never receives a URL, never fetches, never launches a browser and never executes arbitrary code; AWKIT's unchanged identity proof is the only automatic authority; no model call on the run path; mutable data only under %LOCALAPPDATA%/SpecterStudio.",
